Port the performance changes from zortos293/Eglantine@f8f29b576 (PR #71): use the
ordered non-overlapping CFG block set for visited lookups, walk both siblings for order,
and let the first worker or scheduler waiter claim a pipeline build. Graphics configuration
is selected before the build frees its shader modules. Keep the existing completion and
failed-pipeline paths. Skip rasterizer download/write operations for host pointers outside
physical backing, logging only the first 16. Adapted over the effective memory/coherence
layers; ApplyOpOnPointer for physical pointers is unchanged. No frame capture, timing trace,
or unconditional slow-build logging is included.
